WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.689
Congratulations, you have successfully completed the

00:00:06.689 --> 00:00:12.480
course Conversational AI Concepts, Capabilities and Use Cases.

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:17.131
In this course, you learned that conversational AI

00:00:17.131 --> 00:00:21.514
enables more natural, flexible interactions than traditional

00:00:21.514 --> 00:00:27.480
automation by understanding intent, context, and varied user input.

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:32.694
Conversational AI works through a series of coordinated steps,

00:00:32.694 --> 00:00:38.149
including input capture, language processing, intent understanding,

00:00:38.149 --> 00:00:41.840
response generation, and continuous learning.

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:47.517
And different types of conversational AI systems serve different business needs,

00:00:47.517 --> 00:00:52.318
and choosing the right approach requires balancing capabilities, risk,

00:00:52.318 --> 00:00:54.280
and organizational readiness.